                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b3954c5-7ce6-3450-abf0-289e3aac72a5",
                        "entry_id": "fdd272dd-c296-30d0-857a-e955463d85f7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "автопортретная фотография, обычно снятая на небольшую камеру или мобильный телефон без применения таймера, штатива и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b52d8aab-724a-40aa-a065-48827f39695a",
                                "sense_id": "0b3954c5-7ce6-3450-abf0-289e3aac72a5",
                                "text": "Вся сознательная жизнь Лены прошла при Путине, и она относится к президенту и премьеру так, как мы — к Пугачёвой и Киркорову. Она понимает, что лучшее, что можно сделать с ними, — это селфи и что на встрече с Владимиром Путиным совершенно всё равно, какой вопрос задавать."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c2d51062-4333-4c4a-93b0-73c7e65de5c0",
                        "source_entry_id": "fdd272dd-c296-30d0-857a-e955463d85f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b3954c5-7ce6-3450-abf0-289e3aac72a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "selfie",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "selfie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                        "entry_id": "9b2aac11-92e2-38a4-b28e-7e178c2dbbe6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A photographic self-portrait, especially one taken manually (not using a timer, tripod etc.) with a small camera or mobile phone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e49cfd0-d3a1-489d-ab84-16dffd944fa0",
                                                "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                                "text": "Um, drunk at a mates 21st, I tripped ofer and landed lip first (with front teeth coming a very close second) on a set of steps. I had a hole about 1cm long right through my bottom lip. And sorry about the focus, it was a selfie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a586d5c5-22f5-4523-987b-3ec484350601",
                                                "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                                "text": "Pre. Nice rooftop selfie. […] No Hair. Another nice rooftop selfie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50111799-194c-4aea-adb2-b6a1fc48299a",
                                                "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                                "text": "That's not to imply that it's \"wrong\" for your arm or hand to show up in a selfie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7989610e-5326-4080-a0de-8906c66612f6",
                                                "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                                "text": "2012 December 27, Andrew Prince, “The Mars Rover Takes A Selfie” http://www.npr.org/blogs/pictureshow/2012/12/27/168139129/the-mars-rover-takes-a-selfie, the picture show, National Public Radio"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebaa67cb-2461-4aea-ac0f-49337b0b7c57",
                                                "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                                "text": "Barack Obama was talking to David Cameron and with the Danish Prime Minister, and that’s when she actually reached into her purse and brought out a cell phone and stretched her arms and did a selfie with them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d1dbec4-f75b-4571-8abf-a4d8f823157d",
                                                "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                                "text": "I shall take this photograph myself. This must be what they call a selfie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b4ec677-e940-4024-9c8c-4d1c900d2099",
                                                "sense_id": "98e05769-f761-3d19-8adf-d42fe66686d7",
                                                "text": "take a selfie"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b0944fc-c42b-3b1b-80a3-00a571aa3ddc",
                                        "entry_id": "9b2aac11-92e2-38a4-b28e-7e178c2dbbe6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An overly staged or edited self-portrait shared on social media."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "selfie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d6ae58a-6b79-3f34-99e7-5433bc8f68ec",
                                        "entry_id": "01653e81-460c-3709-9ffa-57b108cc81f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take a selfie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c1b0cf26-fa72-4425-8bbc-24b6bc412e7e",
                        "source_entry_id": "fdd272dd-c296-30d0-857a-e955463d85f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b3954c5-7ce6-3450-abf0-289e3aac72a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "selfi",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "selfi",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a9a19b7-01a0-30fc-9617-7ef068d4e1ad",
                                        "entry_id": "76c443fd-7e5d-3b9c-81c6-dd7a4a6abd24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Autorretrato realizado con una cámara fotográfica digital, típicamente de un teléfono móvil o un tablet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "predomina el femenino",
                                            "masculino aparentemente solo en España"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85910384-3d28-4479-9bb6-0433cb4ca231",
                                                "sense_id": "6a9a19b7-01a0-30fc-9617-7ef068d4e1ad",
                                                "text": "Un adolescente muere tras caer de una azotea haciéndose un selfi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acd8716a-fe2b-4ac1-8343-0017a145e324",
                                                "sense_id": "6a9a19b7-01a0-30fc-9617-7ef068d4e1ad",
                                                "text": "Matan a político mexicano mientras tomaba una selfie."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85a726f9-9d4e-4097-a380-5620b28e3e8c",
                        "source_entry_id": "fdd272dd-c296-30d0-857a-e955463d85f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b3954c5-7ce6-3450-abf0-289e3aac72a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Selfie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Selfie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44299fb8-3028-3430-a81b-bfdd99d091f0",
                                        "entry_id": "bfb94e4b-7c8c-3a7d-a579-d44641317e07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "meist mit dem Handy gemachte Bildaufnahme des Auslösenden selbst, in der Regel für den Gebrauch in sozialen Netzwerken bestimmt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "790db04d-c088-498e-81e5-1075f70b55c8",
                                                "sense_id": "44299fb8-3028-3430-a81b-bfdd99d091f0",
                                                "text": "„Selfies sind Fotos, die man von sich selbst schießt. Meist, um sie danach in irgendeinem der interaktiven Chatportale des Internets hochzuladen, am häufigsten bei Facebook.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17d1e198-9eaf-4363-8be7-e598913781e5",
                                                "sense_id": "44299fb8-3028-3430-a81b-bfdd99d091f0",
                                                "text": "„Selfies sind eine weitere dieser kleinen digitalen Drogen, ohne die viele nicht mehr können.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a156ed52-7599-4752-9ae5-bba186fa4f78",
                                                "sense_id": "44299fb8-3028-3430-a81b-bfdd99d091f0",
                                                "text": "„›Für Prominente ist das Selfie mehr als nur eine Dokumentation ihres mehr oder weniger spannenden Lebens; es ist ein hervorragendes Instrument, das eigene Image zu steuern und authentisch zu wirken.‹“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77608299-aafd-4a4e-90b8-53bf9d46edcb",
                                                "sense_id": "44299fb8-3028-3430-a81b-bfdd99d091f0",
                                                "text": "„Selbst bei den Selfies vor der Pforte eines Konzentrationslagers gehen die Meinungen auseinander.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98e3007c-62d1-4022-82f8-0339c42bd637",
                                                "sense_id": "44299fb8-3028-3430-a81b-bfdd99d091f0",
                                                "text": "„Das Internet vergisst nicht. Zumindest eines scheinen die Selfies sagen zu wollen: Die Toten hätten nicht gewollt, dass wir so traurig sind.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7d85f18b-428a-45f6-941f-ef2f93282cba",
                        "source_entry_id": "fdd272dd-c296-30d0-857a-e955463d85f7",
